        "TileImage": "$($repository b2bb92b2-fc85-4817-9499-e49c79e2702e).Image",
        "Description": "Doug, Martin and Craig. Although operating at differing levels of security, these three have become very friendly through years of working together. The clients, Hush and Imogen Royce, reluctantly cooperating, have found their informality and tendency to communicate company secrets between floors via yells unprofessional and potentially career-ending if overheard by the public. If only they knew who they were asking for help from. No worries, a little extra money can&apos;t hurt, can it?",
